\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Our good master, 'cause of  Thy grace,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj   We do humble ourselves.
\par   We give Thee thanks; we give Thee praise,
\par  Thou hast made known Thine love.
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj  Thou gave Thyself so completely,
\par  To people not deserving!
\par  To change into Thy worthy bride,
\par   A limb of Thine body.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  So did the Saviour Jesus Christ,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0   Through Paul revealed to us,
\par  That Christian couples, by their pact,
\par  That binds them into one,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Signify the good pact between
\par Christ and His bridal church,
\par We thus observe and imitate,
\par To make a following,
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. O Lord, help married couples, to
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Reveal through love and truth,
\par Humility, patience and love,
\par And Christian livelihood,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Manifest their Christianity,
\par And have some peace within,
\par To the extent that in future,
\par \pard    They go into heaven.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

